# Early Warning Notification
**CRA Article 14: within 24 hours of becoming aware**
---

**Date:** {{ date }}
**Manufacturer:** {{ manufacturer_name }}

The early warning is the only stage that asks for the product and its identifiers. The 72-hour notification and the final report do not repeat these fields, so anything left out here cannot be added later. Field names follow ENISA's CRA SRP Glossary, version 1.6.

## Required

**Notification type:** [ ] Actively Exploited Vulnerability / [ ] Severe Incident

**Title:** [Concise title, at most 255 characters]

**Summary:** [Short paragraph on what happened and what is affected]

**Member States where product available (CSIRT Designated as Coordinator and Concerned CSIRTs):** {% if target_eu_markets %}{{ target_eu_markets|join:", " }}{% else %}[List the Member States]{% endif %}
{% if csirt_country %}
**CSIRT designated as coordinator:** {{ csirt_country }}
{% endif %}

**Product name:** {{ product_name }}

**Product version:** [Affected version or version range]

**Date and time you became aware (UTC):** [YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM]

**Incident is suspected of unlawful or malicious acts (severe incidents only):** [Free text]

## Optional, and only at this stage

**Additional Information:** [At most 255 characters]

**Product type, class and category:** [Default / Important / Critical, and its class and category]

**End of the support indicator:** [ ] Yes / [ ] No

**Component name:** [Affected component and version, from the SBOM]

**CVE ID / EUVD ID (vulnerabilities only):** [CVE-YYYY-NNNNN / EUVD-YYYY-NNNNN]

**Mitigating measure expected shortly:** [ ] Yes / [ ] No

**User action able to reduce impact:** [What users can do now]

**Date and time the vulnerability was exploited or the incident occurred (UTC):** [YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM]

## Contact Information

{% if security_contact_email %}
**Security Contact:** {{ security_contact_email }}
{% endif %}
{% if manufacturer_email %}
**Manufacturer Contact:** {{ manufacturer_email }}
{% endif %}

---
> Submit via the ENISA Single Reporting Platform (SRP), which makes it available to the CSIRT designated as coordinator and to ENISA.
> This notification must be submitted within 24 hours of becoming aware of the vulnerability or incident.
